(7038696, 1069252, 99263, '<td valign="top">Quite beautifully done and with lovely play of light. Not really very painting-like to my mind though, more photo realistic. I would have liked it even better if you had cropped of about an inch from the left and right as now there is just a bit too much empty space on both sides. Also the top and bottom crop is just a little tight, about half an inch extra space top and bottom would have been perfect.</td>', 'Quite beautifully done and with lovely play of light. Not really very painting-like to my mind though, more photo realistic. I would have liked it even better if you had cropped of about an inch from the left and right as now there is just a bit too much empty space on both sides. Also the top and bottom crop is just a little tight, about half an inch extra space top and bottom would have been perfect.', '2013-05-17 07:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
