(7039321, 1069610, 108580, '<td valign="top">Indeed a characteristic "painters" pertinent statement aimed at the Middle East? All sides too, depending on which fence you sit. It may appear to "photographic" for DPC''ers with a penchant for compartmental and partisan voting. I really wished more of them would be open minded and with Google Images at their fingertips, do more research. Here''s a 9 for your bold and thoughtful statement and your killer skills.</td>', 'Indeed a characteristic "painters" pertinent statement aimed at the Middle East? All sides too, depending on which fence you sit. It may appear to "photographic" for DPC''ers with a penchant for compartmental and partisan voting. I really wished more of them would be open minded and with Google Images at their fingertips, do more research. Here''s a 9 for your bold and thoughtful statement and your killer skills.', '2013-05-18 03:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
