(7039327, 1069671, 108580, '<td valign="top">DMC but I really am getting to dislike this "PS" paint style filter, especially when it is used aggressively. That doesn''t mean I''m giving you a 1 but you can see from a lot of the other entries that it, or a custom version of it is rather popular, and overcooked.</td>', 'DMC but I really am getting to dislike this "PS" paint style filter, especially when it is used aggressively. That doesn''t mean I''m giving you a 1 but you can see from a lot of the other entries that it, or a custom version of it is rather popular, and overcooked.', '2013-05-18 03:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
