(7039343, 1069649, 108580, '<td valign="top">It''s one of your lovely rural images again yet I would prefer to see his (and their) faces. The effect is more grain-like than painting like and that relates, to me at least, to a film effect. But I am no artist :)</td>', 'It''s one of your lovely rural images again yet I would prefer to see his (and their) faces. The effect is more grain-like than painting like and that relates, to me at least, to a film effect. But I am no artist :)', '2013-05-18 04:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
