(7039612, 1069617, 114225, '<td valign="top">Well done with the composition. A bit heavy on the neon colors. Tone that down, and I would have scored it higher.</td>', 'Well done with the composition. A bit heavy on the neon colors. Tone that down, and I would have scored it higher.', '2013-05-18 20:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
