(7041552, 1069694, 12611, '<td valign="top">First off, great shapes and lines- the tilt and bow suggest too much angle for this to be water and sky- not a straight enough horizon- and the mind is nicely deceived. Secondly, the purples and greenish cerulean blues add a swirling of warmth and color that reminds me of Monet''s Water lilies 3 panel wall at MOMA..</td>', 'First off, great shapes and lines- the tilt and bow suggest too much angle for this to be water and sky- not a straight enough horizon- and the mind is nicely deceived. Secondly, the purples and greenish cerulean blues add a swirling of warmth and color that reminds me of Monet''s Water lilies 3 panel wall at MOMA..', '2013-05-22 09:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7041557, 1069411, 12611, '<td valign="top">For some reason, this shot reminds me of <i>Interior of a Picture Gallery with the Collection of Cardinal Silvio Valenti Gonzaga Artist: Giovanni Paolo Panini</i>. I like the detail and the shadow- and the way you have processed the stone and wood, especially the tile.</td>', 'For some reason, this shot reminds me of Interior of a Picture Gallery with the Collection of Cardinal Silvio Valenti Gonzaga Artist: Giovanni Paolo Panini. I like the detail and the shadow- and the way you have processed the stone and wood, especially the tile.', '2013-05-22 09:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
