(7042304, 1069014, 63218, '<td valign="top">I admire this. The way you use your camera to create art. Thank you. <br/> <br/>And here is a Flying Pig to let you know how much I appreciate this.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1038123" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1038123.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Check out <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1171726&amp;highlight=flying%20pig&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">The Flying Pig</a> thread to see more.</td>', 'I admire this. The way you use your camera to create art. Thank you.  And here is a Flying Pig to let you know how much I appreciate this.  Check out The Flying Pig thread to see more.', '2013-05-23 18:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7042306, 1069763, 63218, '<td valign="top">And wouldn''t this look absolutely fabulous printed on a large canvas, hanging on the wall in a room that didn''t get direct sunlight. This painting would provide all the sunny light anyone would need. I like the way it''s mostly abstract, but not quite. And of course I love tulips. Good work!</td>', 'And wouldn''t this look absolutely fabulous printed on a large canvas, hanging on the wall in a room that didn''t get direct sunlight. This painting would provide all the sunny light anyone would need. I like the way it''s mostly abstract, but not quite. And of course I love tulips. Good work!', '2013-05-23 18:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7042308, 1069762, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is so charming, I keep trying to look past the effects filter to see it better. <br/>Beautiful light &amp; shadow.</td>', 'This is so charming, I keep trying to look past the effects filter to see it better. Beautiful light & shadow.', '2013-05-23 19:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
