(7042579, 1069613, 135744, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all the lovely compliments. I just love this view and walk past it in our village every morning. With the recent addition of the cows it made a perfect scene for this challenge. Sad things is they plan to build a load of new houses in this field:(</td>', 'Thank you for all the lovely compliments. I just love this view and walk past it in our village every morning. With the recent addition of the cows it made a perfect scene for this challenge. Sad things is they plan to build a load of new houses in this field:(', '2013-05-24 02:59:02.000000', NULL, 0),
