(7042673, 1069687, 127021, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> Very well done, Chris!  Helps too that you do have a bit of van Gogh about you.  Do you actually have bi-coloured eyes or did you change the colour in one for effect? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s a result of dodging and burning too late at night. ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by snaffles: Very well done, Chris!  Helps too that you do have a bit of van Gogh about you.  Do you actually have bi-coloured eyes or did you change the colour in one for effect?   That''s a result of dodging and burning too late at night. ;)', '2013-05-24 10:41:13.000000', NULL, 0),
