(7042676, 1069750, 3306, '<td valign="top">Oh Gosh. I was wrong. Sorry about the mistaken identity. None the less a wonderful and creative masterpiece. You deserve the ribbon all the same. You are an outstanding artist. I now have another favorite! Congratulations on a top 10.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-05-24 09:51:38.</i></td>', 'Oh Gosh. I was wrong. Sorry about the mistaken identity. None the less a wonderful and creative masterpiece. You deserve the ribbon all the same. You are an outstanding artist. I now have another favorite! Congratulations on a top 10.', '2013-05-24 10:50:21.000000', '2013-05-24 10:51:38.000000', 0),
(7042678, 1069247, 23098, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and processing, really like the color tones.</td>', 'Nice capture and processing, really like the color tones.', '2013-05-24 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7042684, 1069750, 43463, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM Jenn! A very poignant piece. Time does indeed have a hold on us. It sweeps us away and passes ''whether we want it to or not''. I love the texture on this piece because it gives it a sense of age - perfect since this visual art addresses the subject of Time. Just one observation I made: The ''hands of time'' only represent two moments in time (11:40 and 10:09). It might have been best to have different times to represent ''time stands still for no one'' or, upon, further reflection one can deduce that it represents those particular moments in time slipping away.</td>', 'Congrats on the HM Jenn! A very poignant piece. Time does indeed have a hold on us. It sweeps us away and passes ''whether we want it to or not''. I love the texture on this piece because it gives it a sense of age - perfect since this visual art addresses the subject of Time. Just one observation I made: The ''hands of time'' only represent two moments in time (11:40 and 10:09). It might have been best to have different times to represent ''time stands still for no one'' or, upon, further reflection one can deduce that it represents those particular moments in time slipping away.', '2013-05-24 11:15:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7042685, 1069490, 43463, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Red!!! This has all the mood, period time, and lighting (absolutely love the light) of paintings by the Old World Masters such as Rembrandt and others of that era. I also love the humor of the piece where this gent is talking down to this ''mother hen''.</td>', 'Congrats on the Red!!! This has all the mood, period time, and lighting (absolutely love the light) of paintings by the Old World Masters such as Rembrandt and others of that era. I also love the humor of the piece where this gent is talking down to this ''mother hen''.', '2013-05-24 11:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7042688, 1069702, 43463, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue! Very well done tribute to Dali''s surrealist paintings! I like the stream of free floating thoughts that we can see behind the face. What they mean will rest with each individual''s interpretation. To me, those free form shapes and lines are perhaps representative of the creative thought process:-)</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue! Very well done tribute to Dali''s surrealist paintings! I like the stream of free floating thoughts that we can see behind the face. What they mean will rest with each individual''s interpretation. To me, those free form shapes and lines are perhaps representative of the creative thought process:-)', '2013-05-24 11:28:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7042693, 1069739, 30861, '<td valign="top">Wonderful write-up, Christophe. It''s always fascinating to follow your thought process in making one of your works. Congratulations on top-ten with your "too photographic" piece of art, LOL.</td>', 'Wonderful write-up, Christophe. It''s always fascinating to follow your thought process in making one of your works. Congratulations on top-ten with your "too photographic" piece of art, LOL.', '2013-05-24 11:35:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7042696, 1069490, 67258, '<td valign="top">Fab!  I''m sure the hen is going to love the photo; do tell us what the man''s reaction was to you presenting him with a bag of corn :P</td>', 'Fab!  I''m sure the hen is going to love the photo; do tell us what the man''s reaction was to you presenting him with a bag of corn :P', '2013-05-24 11:48:09.000000', NULL, 0),
