(7042737, 1069687, 59029, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mrchhas:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by snaffles:</b></div><hr/><i> Very well done, Chris!  Helps too that you do have a bit of van Gogh about you.  Do you actually have bi-coloured eyes or did you change the colour in one for effect? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s a result of dodging and burning too late at night. ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah, you gotta watch that d&amp;b after midnight!  Still makes for a very cool image.</td>', 'Originally posted by mrchhas: Originally posted by snaffles: Very well done, Chris!  Helps too that you do have a bit of van Gogh about you.  Do you actually have bi-coloured eyes or did you change the colour in one for effect?   That''s a result of dodging and burning too late at night. ;)   Yeah, you gotta watch that d&b after midnight!  Still makes for a very cool image.', '2013-05-24 13:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
