(7044105, 1069702, 123833, '<td valign="top">I will stand by my earlier comment, sorry. I don''t know what it is specifically though. Overall, you are a great artist, Alex, and developing really fast. This is a great effort. Very impressive. <br/> <br/>I wish we had more challenges like this one that unleash the incredible creativity of the best artists DPC has. Just voting on the other current challenges emphasizes this point so much! :(</td>', 'I will stand by my earlier comment, sorry. I don''t know what it is specifically though. Overall, you are a great artist, Alex, and developing really fast. This is a great effort. Very impressive.  I wish we had more challenges like this one that unleash the incredible creativity of the best artists DPC has. Just voting on the other current challenges emphasizes this point so much! :(', '2013-05-28 09:03:12.000000', NULL, 0),
