(7044598, 1069490, 70128, '<td valign="top">My favorite! I could stare at this picture for hours. There is a whole story behind this, that each viewer can imagine in their own minds. While mostly real, this picture is exactly like a painting. Love the colors, love the theme, love the setting. I also really enjoyed reading your "tale"!! Congrats to you, to the guy and to the chicken! I must say, I''d like to have a print of this too, and frame it!</td>', 'My favorite! I could stare at this picture for hours. There is a whole story behind this, that each viewer can imagine in their own minds. While mostly real, this picture is exactly like a painting. Love the colors, love the theme, love the setting. I also really enjoyed reading your "tale"!! Congrats to you, to the guy and to the chicken! I must say, I''d like to have a print of this too, and frame it!', '2013-05-29 11:00:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7044727, 1069477, 40718, '<td valign="top">Ha.  Monica, I have to say I''ll be happy when this is off the front page because it creeps me out.  You did a great job!</td>', 'Ha.  Monica, I have to say I''ll be happy when this is off the front page because it creeps me out.  You did a great job!', '2013-05-29 15:21:39.000000', NULL, 0),
